<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Invitation to ROW Permitting Quarterly Meeting via WebEx</h1>
<table class="govd_hr" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" width="100%" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr class="govd_hr_inner"><td width="100%"><hr></td></tr></table>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We hope this message finds you well. You are invited to attend the upcoming <strong>ROW Permitting Quarterly Meeting</strong>, which will be held via WebEx. This meeting is intended for all stakeholders who work in or occupy the City of Columbus Right-of-Way (ROW).</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;"><strong>Meeting Details:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">
<strong>Date:</strong> Tuesday, December 16, 2025</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">
<strong>Time:</strong> 10:00am</li>
<li style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 7px;">
<strong>Location:</strong> WebEx <a href="https://cocmeetings.webex.com/cocmeetings/j.php?MTID=m7daf95a332117fcff87c2b4b268d2401&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">(Click Here)</a>
</li>
</ul>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">We encourage you to submit any ROW permit or inspection-related questions in advance. Please send your questions to either <a style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">JKKelley@columbus.gov</a> or <a style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">JWElfrink@columbus.gov</a> by <strong>Monday, December 15, 2025, at Noon</strong>.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Your participation is vital to the success of this meeting, and we look forward to your valuable input.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Thank you, and we hope to see you there!</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Best regards,</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">DPS ROW Permit Team</p>
</td>
